  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFinish.FineByYou": "[pg]Fine by you. You leave her to her \"prayers\" and make your way back to camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFinish.PartWonders": "[pg]Part of you wonders how much of her is just a character she's playing, and how much of her has genuine faith in a god of phalli. It doesn't really matter in the end, you think. You'll have fun with the habit every once in a while."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFinish.TakesHabitBeams": "You take the habit, and the nun beams with pious happiness. [say: Thank you, stranger, faith is difficult to come by in such harsh times. Yours is an important task. Spread His word wherever you go. Do not demean His power and your capacity for change; one person can make all the difference in the world.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFinish.ThankAgain": "[pg][say: Thank you, again. Leave me now, please. I must commute with the Lord once again.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFuckOffMormons.LooksDisappointed": "[pg]She looks a bit disappointed, but soon returns to her serene look. [say: Very well, stranger. I was too forward to ask this of you. Hopefully, in time, my Lord will show you His light and you will return here. No one can be forced to accept truth.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFuckOffMormons.RaisesHands": "You raise your hands and tell her to stop. You're not interested in joining a church of dicks."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunFuckOffMormons.WhateverShrugging": "[pg]Whatever. After shrugging her words off, she breathes deeply and returns to her libidinous prayer. You're not sure why you expected any purity in religion in this land."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunJoinReligion.DespiteRude": "Despite your rude introduction to her \"religion\", you have to admit, you're quite the fan of dicks as well. [if (hascock) {Especially yours.}] With libidinous anticipation boiling inside you, you tell her you accept, but you're unsure of what it would entail."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunJoinReligion.SmilesSerenely": "[pg]She smiles serenely again, having completely reverted to her peaceful facade. [say: If you truly love Him, then all you need to do is continue with your worship. But inferior beings that we are, we might need some type of motivation, a physical crutch for our devotion. I understand.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunJoinReligion.TakesChest": "[pg]She takes a small chest from the ground next to her and opens it, revealing a navy blue, satin habit much like her own. [say: Here. A gift from His magnificence. May He bless you as he has blessed me.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunJoinReligion.TakesHabit": "[pg]You take the satin habit. Feeling the texture on your fingers already brings your imagination alight with images of dicks of all shapes and sizes, and something compels you to wear it immediately. There's definitely some type of magic imbued in this."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunMaybeLater.CantTakeHabit": "You can't really take the habit right now."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunMaybeLater.FindingAnother": "[pg][say: Finding another member of the faith is exhilarating, but I must enter communion with my Lord alone. Please, come back later.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunMaybeLater.FineByYou": "[pg]Fine by you. You leave her to her \"prayers\" and make your way back to camp."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunMaybeLater.IUnderstand": "[pg][say: I understand. Do not worry; the habit is merely an aid in your quest to spread His word. It is not necessary. If you ever need it, however, just come back to me.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunMaybeLater.Nod": "[pg]You nod."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.BePatient": "You decide to be patient, and wait for her orgasm to subside."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.FeelYourTouch": "[pg][say: Lord, I feel your touch! It ravages me, spreads me! Please, let me serve you further! Give me a sign!]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.KneelsAgain": "[pg]She kneels again. She brings a hand down her thighs and thrusts the cross inside herself a few times. She sighs, and looks directly at you."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.MoansLoudly": "[pg]She moans loudly, and eventually it trails down into a sigh again. She breathes deeply, and in a moment, she has returned to her old, calming self."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.NewSurge": "[pg]As she finishes speaking, a new surge of pleasure hits her, and she squirts again. She spasms in place, unable to contain herself."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.NotDifficult": "[pg][say: It is not difficult, and it brings great pleasure. Just praise his instrument of procreation, place it atop everything else in your life, and you will be blessed with His glory.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.RubsThighsAgain": "[pg]She rubs her thighs again."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.ServeHimWord": "[pg]Serve \"Him\"?"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.SpreadTheWord": "[pg][say: Spread the word of His magnificence, praise Him wherever he appears. What do you say?]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.ThankRemaining": "[pg][say: Thank you for remaining with me. As I prayed, I had a vision. My Lord has talked to me, and He sees your potential. He believes you would be a great servant for him. He sees your potential!]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.JoinNunStay.YesISeeIt": "[pg][say: Yes! Yes! I see it! I will follow your guidance! Yes!]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.DefinitelyNot": " Definitely not what you're used to seeing in the monastery where you grew up."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.DetailsClear": "[pg]As you approach, more details become clear to you. The person kneeling is obviously female, and she seems to repeat some type of prayer to herself. What you thought were robes are actually a nun's habit, a very short one at that, revealing much of her thick thighs."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.LakesShore": "Walking along the lake's shore, you spot something over the distance; someone kneeling, clad in blue robes. From where you are standing, it looks harmless enough, and curiosity gets the better of you."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.ScratchHead": "[pg]You scratch your head. How do you answer her?"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.WalkingMoments": "[pg]After a few moments of walking, you get close enough to the woman to grab her attention. Her eyes are closed, her hands locked together in prayer. A small, unambitious shrine sits in front of her, composed of a small wooden cross, a couple of candles, and an assortment of flowers. Without looking at you, she addresses you."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNun.WorldBeautiful": "[pg][say: This world, it is beautiful, is it not?] she asks. You're a bit puzzled by the sudden question, but answer in an uncompromising way.[pg][say: I understand you may be hesitant to praise this land, as it has suffered much. But life, no matter the form, must be praised and celebrated, for it is a gift of our Lord to us, his humble servants.]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNunAgain.GoodToSeeAgain": "[pg][say: Good to see you again, stranger. What brings you here? Do you wish to pray with me?]"
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNunAgain.LakesShore": "Walking along the lake's shore, you encounter the nun once again, and, once again, she is kneeling, praying for her god."
  "Scenes.Cultistnunscene.MeetCultistNunAgain.NodsChest": "[pg]She nods towards a small chest next to her. [say: If you wish to join my faith, the offer still stands.]"
}
